I have strictly locked down the **Recycle Bin & Universal Undo** feature to **Super Admin only**:

1. **Sidebar Navigation**:
   * The **"Recycle Bin & Undo"** tab in the sidebar is set to `visible: isSuperAdmin`.  
   * Staff accounts will **never see** this menu item.

2. **Route / Page Access Guard**:
   * If any staff account attempts to access `/admin/recycle-bin`, the security guard intercepts it:  
     `if (!isSuperAdmin) return accessDenied;`  
   * Staff cannot view, open, or interact with the page.

3. **Firestore Security Rules**:
   * In `firestore.rules`, we enforced database-level restrictions:
     ```firestore
     match /recycle_bin/{id} {
       // Only Super Admin can read, view, restore, or permanently purge items
       allow read, update, delete: if isSuperAdmin();
       // System allows archiving when deletions happen
       allow create: if isSuperAdmin() || isAdmin();
     }
     ```
